  <main>
    <section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">About Roy</div><h1>Tech entrepreneur. Builder. Practical public voice.</h1><p class="lead">Roy Li is a tech entrepreneur with a deep interest in public policy, responsible government, and the future of British Columbia.</p></section>
    <section class="content">
      <p>Roy’s background is rooted in technology, business, capital markets, and building through uncertainty. He understands that confidence is not created by speeches. It is created by predictable rules, disciplined budgets, safe communities, lower red tape, and a government that respects the people who create jobs and pay taxes.</p>
      <p>Roy is currently developing his public profile and policy views with a focus on Vancouver-Langara. He has not made this website an official campaign site; it is a place for residents, supporters, and interested citizens to learn who he is and what he believes.</p>
      <h2>Why public service matters</h2>
      <p>British Columbia needs leaders who are practical, economically literate, and willing to say that government has limits. A province can be compassionate without being careless. It can invest in the future without ignoring the budget. It can support vulnerable people while still defending public order and public safety.</p>
